---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro'; export function getStaticPaths(){return [{params:{lang:'en'}}];}
---
<BaseLayout noindex title="PCam licenses — prototype" description="Prototype license status and renewal workflow for PCam customers.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Prototype · Customer area" title="License management" lead="Static UX for the future license service. The existing legacy SOAP service can later sit behind a server-side endpoint without exposing it to the browser." crumbs={[{label:'Support',href:'/en/support/'},{label:'Licenses'}]} />
<section class="section"><div class="container grid grid--2" style="gap:40px;align-items:start"><div class="mock-window"><div class="mock-bar"><span class="mock-dot"></span><span class="mock-dot"></span><span class="mock-dot"></span></div><div class="mock-body"><div class="spread"><div><p class="eyebrow">Installed licenses</p><h2 style="font-size:2.35rem">ACME Tooling</h2></div><span class="pill pill--red">Mock</span></div><div class="mock-list"><div class="mock-list-row"><strong>PCamMES</strong><span>5 seats</span><span class="mock-status">Active</span></div><div class="mock-list-row"><strong>PCamWire AdvConic</strong><span>2 seats</span><span class="mock-status">Active</span></div><div class="mock-list-row"><strong>PCamMonitor</strong><span>12 machines</span><span class="mock-status">Active</span></div></div></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Future integration</p><h2>Keep the legacy service behind a clean contract.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:20px">The browser should call a PCam endpoint. That server endpoint can validate customer identity, call the existing license SOAP service, normalize the response and log the transaction.</p><div class="architecture" style="margin-top:26px"><div class="arch-flow" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><div class="arch-node"><strong>Customer portal</strong><span>Authenticated request</span></div><div class="arch-node"><strong>PCam API</strong><span>Authorization + normalization</span></div><div class="arch-node"><strong>LicensesWS</strong><span>Existing SOAP backend</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
